rclonecrypt: rclone's crypt cipher, vendored so a per-app guest reads and writes the SAME format the standard runtime's
rclone does (scripts/enclave-encvol.sh, wasm/wasm_manager.py) without carrying the 61.6 MB rclone binary in every guest.

